Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:09.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a really hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:10.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,problem to solve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:11.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,and that's why we're
