Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:14.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,blanket movements to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:16.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,just... And I think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:17.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,that's what we're going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:18.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,to start to see long
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,term, is people opening
